# Bellhaven CRM reconciliation — proposes daily at 09:00. Never applies.
#
#   crontab -e   and paste the line below, adjusting the path.
#
# Approved changes are written only when a human runs `make apply` (or presses
# "Apply approved to CRM" in the review app), so an unattended run can never
# modify the CRM.

0 9 * * * .venv/bin/python -m bellhaven.pipeline >> data/cron.log 2>&1
